 <46025606+Ken5998@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:07:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(linux): say the resolution applies after a restart on
 vulkan

Only the D3D12 command processor rebuilds itself at a new scale while the
game runs; with Vulkan the Display > Resolution row now reads
"Resolution (restart)".
---
 project/src/options_menu.cpp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/project/src/options_menu.cpp b/project/src/options_menu.cpp
index 39b4527..57ac42d 100644
--- a/project/src/options_menu.cpp
+++ b/project/src/options_menu.cpp
@@ -183,7 +183,13 @@ struct Row {
 
 std::vector<Row>& Rows() {
   static std::vector<Row> rows = {
+#ifdef _WIN32
       {"Resolution",
+#else
+      // Only the D3D12 command processor rebuilds itself at a new scale while
+      // running; with Vulkan the scale (res_scale.txt) applies at start-up.
+      {"Resolution (restart)",
+#endif
        {"640 x 480 (restart)", "800 x 600 (restart)", "1280 x 720 (native)", "2560 x 1440 (2x)",
         "3840 x 2160 (3x)"},
        [] {
